+ * a clear, in-pass barrier of a multisampled pass, blit and resolve region), MoltenVK when
+ * it encodes the command buffer (at vkQueueSubmit, or at vkEndCommandBuffer with prefill),
+ * all command buffers of one batch into one Metal command buffer. A command buffer may
+ * open VKR_ENCODER_CAP, a MoltenVK batch twice that; past it the app's context ends.
+ * OMACVM_VENUS_ENCODER_CAP sets it (tests). */
